  "summary": "Mozart was born at Salzburg on 27 January 1756 and died on 5 December 1791, aged 35. From 1781 to 1791 he was permanently resident in Vienna, where he composed the works for which he is best remembered. He married Constanze Weber in 1782 in St Stephen's Cathedral in Vienna.",
